cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cuvette, cite it with the metadata in this file. Also cite each science program and each dataset that your analysis used. CREDITS.md lists them."
title: "Cuvette"
abstract: "Cuvette is a terminal agent that runs existing science programs through adapters. The scientist owns the method decisions. Cuvette records each step, each decision and each number."
